      "body": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efa04939-9d16-413f-b32b-edbd1ae79ed3 \n\n**The buttons on top are just for testing purpose so i can show how the duplication is working**\n1. The three button showing that i was able dupliocate the whole tree , a sub tree and a leaf node  currently the offset is 60/40 \n\ndoes it match the requirement of the issue ? \nPlease feel free to ask question and correct me if you find me wrong anywhere or you think i should improve something particular\n\n\nButton | Copies | Verified result\n-- | -- | --\nDuplicate start (whole tower) | all 24 bricks | new 24-node tower at +60/+40 px\nDuplicate a note (sub-tree) | the 3-note chain + pitches + args = 21 bricks | new 21-node tower, mid-cavity slice\nDuplicate a pitch (leaf) | pitch + 2 args = 3 bricks | new 3-node tower\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 440; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Verified live in the store (not just visually):</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: outside disc; margin-inline-start: 0px; padding-inline-start: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 440; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">Fresh ids</strong><span> </span>— every copied brick id disjoint from the source's, all unique within the copy</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">Original untouched</strong><span> </span>— source tower still 24 nodes at (400,100)</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">Offset placement</strong><span> </span>— copies land exactly at<span> </span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 1em; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-weight: 500; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(0.985098 0.000048918 none / 0.08); direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; border-radius: 4px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">source + (60, 40)</code>, spread diagonally on repeat clicks</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">Independent</strong><span> </span>— copy root has<span> </span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 1em; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-weight: 500; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(0.985098 0.000048918 none / 0.08); direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; border-radius: 4px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">prev: null</code>, only internal<span> </span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-size: 1em; color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-weight: 500; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(0.985098 0.000048918 none / 0.08); direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; border-radius: 4px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;\">next</code>/cavity links</li></ul>\n\n(PS- ignore any bg noise if you find any)\n",
