      "body": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66b85a83-a6ae-46a1-8882-9d67c3c19c4f\n\n###Update\n1. Wired it with a wedge menu and as we can see the following stuff which was initially asked in the PR is now being solved\nI've attached a short screen recording demonstrating the completed Duplicate wedge flow for https://github.com/sugarlabs/musicblocks-v4/issues/796.\n\nThe recording verifies:\n\n- Undo removes the duplicated tower correctly.\n- Redo restores the duplicated tower correctly.\n- Keyboard undo/redo also works fine\n\n\nThe implementation has also been verified with the full test suite, lint, TypeScript checks, and git diff --check.\n\nall tests has been passed now opening the PR for review, please guide me and tell me what changes i need to make to keep it as a smooth experience for me as well as the community (maintainers and contributors)",
